  "decision_conditions": [
    "The single storey rear extension by reason of its size, siting, and excessive depth would have an overbearing effect upon the adjoining property No. 75 Linden Way, resulting in a loss of light and outlook detrimental to the amenities of that adjoining property contrary to Local Plan Policy CP30 and Development Management Document Policies DMD11 and DMD37.",
    "The single storey rear extension, due to excessive depth, overall scale and materials would result in an overly dominant, visually intrusive and discordant form of development detrimental to the character of the existing property and surrounding area.  This would be contrary to Local Plan Policy CP30, Policies DMD8, DMD11 and DMD37 of the Development Management Document and Policy 7.4 of the London Plan."
